    {
      "type": "learn_card",
      "id": "B7.11.3.S16",
      "skills": [
        "book.words",
        "vocab.meaning"
      ],
      "text": {
        "hi": "‘g’ दो तरह से बोला जाता है: gap में ‘ग’ जैसा, और gem में ‘ज’ जैसा। अक्सर g के बाद e, i, y हो तो ‘ज’ (gem, giant), नहीं तो ‘ग’ (gap, grow)। पर give और get अपवाद हैं!",
        "hinglish": "‘g’ do tarah se bola jaata hai: gap mein ‘ga’ jaisa, aur gem mein ‘ja’ jaisa. Aksar g ke baad e, i, y ho to ‘ja’ (gem, giant), nahi to ‘ga’ (gap, grow). Par give aur get apvaad hain!",
        "en": "‘g’ has two sounds: like ‘g’ in gap and like ‘j’ in gem. Usually g before e, i or y sounds like j (gem, giant); otherwise like g (gap, grow). But give and get are exceptions!"
      }
    },
